# Linting & Quality Gates

- ESLint config extends Next.js and TypeScript via [eslint.config.mjs](mdc:eslint.config.mjs).
- Keep imports ordered and unused code removed.
- No console logs in server-side code except structured diagnostics.
- Run `npm run lint` before commits; fix autofixable issues.
